# INERT MARKER -- a TEXT file with a .so name. It is not an ELF object, contains
# no code of any kind, and could not be loaded by ld.so if anything tried.
# It exists so etc/ld.so.preload names an unowned path in the same directory the
# unit's ExecStart points into: that shared directory is what makes the findings
# correlate into one cluster instead of three unrelated alerts.
